FastVideo block-sparse attention
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MiniMax-H3 SM121 block-sparse attention specialization in
src/runtime/models/minimax_h3/vsa_attention_sm121.ptx is a generated and
modified derivative of the FastVideo Triton kernel:

  Upstream: https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo
  Revision: 3d8ac9d14bd697a89ede8f170cbfbca012a9edcc
  Source: fastvideo-kernel/python/fastvideo_kernel/triton_kernels/block_sparse_attn_triton.py
  License: Apache License 2.0

The upstream source describes the implementation as based on FlashAttention-2
by Tri Dao (https://tridao.me/publications/flash2/flash2.pdf) and credits the
OpenAI kernel team. The generated PTX was modified by NVIDIA in 2026 for the
SM121 MiniMax-H3 runtime integration.

